      Title: Sunrise Sausage Squares
 Categories:
      Yield: 0 Servings

      1 lb Pork sausage
           - roll
      2 bread -- cut into 1/2 inch cu
           - bes
    3/4  c green peppers -- diced
      1  c shredded sharp Cheddar cheese
      6    eggs
      2 milk
    1/2 ts salt
    1/2 ts dry mustard

Preheat oven to 350 degrees F. Cook the sausage in a skillet until browned.

Bake until set. Let stand 5 minutes before cutting into squares; serve hot.

Source:
  "Example Diner"
Notes:
  "Serve squares on toasted muffins."
Yield:
  6 Servings"
